msgid "Tome_of_Wild_Magic@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Wild Magic"

msgid "Tome_of_Wild_Magic@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"\"Your innate magic comes from the wild forces of chaos that underlie the "
"order of creation. You might have endured exposure to some form of raw "
"magic, perhaps through a planar portal leading to Limbo, the Elemental "
"Planes, or the mysterious Far Realm. Perhaps you were blessed by a powerful "
"fey creature or marked by a demon. Or your magic could be a fluke of your "
"birth, with no apparent cause or reason. However it came to be, this chaotic "
"magic churns within you, waiting for any outlet.\""

msgid "Tome_of_Wild_Magic@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Gilean the Gray Voyager"

msgid "Tome_of_Wild_Magic@GAMEPLAY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"You didn't choose the power it chose you. Wield powerful spells and gain a "
"better understanding of one's own power. Take advantage of the new effect "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROSTBITE.Hyperlink} to control the battlefield."

