msgid "Tome_of_Cryogenics@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Cryogenics"

msgid "Tome_of_Cryogenics@Tome@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"\"In the ancient, frost-bound kingdom of Aeryndor, the art of Cryogenics was "
"discovered—an arcane craft that allowed powerful sorcerers to freeze both "
"life and time itself. Legends speak of mighty warriors and noble monarchs "
"who chose eternal slumber in crystalline tombs, hoping to awaken in an age "
"of their choosing. Yet, with each awakening, some return not as they were, "
"but as empty echoes of their former selves, lost to the frost’s unyielding "
"grip.\""

msgid "Tome_of_Cryogenics@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Elara Frostwhisper"

msgid "Tome_of_Cryogenics@SKILL_01@NAME"
