"{WINTER_FRONT_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Frost} {GLOBAL.FrostDamageConcept.Hyperlink} for "
"each stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.FROSTBITE.Hyperlink} they have."
"[bullet/]Lasts {FROSTBITE_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:"
"{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>.[/bulletlist]"

